WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:05.280
Environmental factors shape drone safety, control, endurance, navigation, data quality,

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.000
and mission outcomes.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.910
Wind, temperature, moisture, visibility, lighting, terrain, obstacles, radio conditions,

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:13.000
and navigation signals interact rather than acting alone.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Evaluate forecasts, current site conditions, aircraft and payload guidance,

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.195
crew capability, route, margins, and emergency options before flight.

00:00:21.195 --> 00:00:25.015
Average wind or a battery percentage by itself does not describe operational risk.

00:00:25.015 --> 00:00:30.000
During flight, monitor gusts, power use, visibility, image quality, navigation behavior,

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.215
signal trends, obstacles, and changing ground activity.

00:00:32.215 --> 00:00:34.000
Recover early when margins narrow.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Automated avoidance and return functions remain limited tools.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.956
Record weather, site observations, decisions, deviations, alerts, and outcome.

00:00:40.956 --> 00:00:44.935
Use after-action review to improve future thresholds, maintenance, collection timing,

00:00:44.935 --> 00:00:46.250
and crew briefings.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.680
Remember that risks compound.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:52.055
Moderate wind, cold battery performance, weak signal, difficult terrain,

00:00:52.055 --> 00:00:55.560
and fading light may each appear manageable alone while their combined effect removes the

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.000
margin needed for a controlled return.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.520
The goal is safe, lawful, conservative operation,

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:02.000
not forcing a mission through unsafe conditions.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.210
A delay or cancellation is successful risk management when the environment cannot support

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.000
controlled flight and useful data.
